WEBVTT

00:25:59.747 --> 00:26:01.059
of the TED Interview.

00:26:01.083 --> 00:26:05.651
And it was so moving how you spoke
about your grief then.

00:26:05.675 --> 00:26:09.681
And I feel like that's a potential
resource to people.

00:26:09.705 --> 00:26:14.195
I know we were both
sitting there shedding tears,

00:26:14.219 --> 00:26:20.616
and I found that an extraordinary
experience personally, to be sure.

00:26:21.278 --> 00:26:23.142
But somehow ...

00:26:24.145 --> 00:26:26.567
in this moment,

00:26:26.591 --> 00:26:31.048
if you follow this journey of curiosity,